  "description": "A library for creating, extracting, listing, and rewriting Xbox ISO (XISO) disc images. C# port of extract-xiso (reference build 202609111233), extended with XboxKit archival (Redump video/filler/seed/wipe/trim/petrify/rebuild, ZAR) and xdvdfs packing (build-image, CISO). Reads plain ISO, split .1.iso sets, CISO, CCI/CCIM and ZAR inputs through one detection layer; packs to an explicit sector layout (`XisoLayoutSpec`/`--layout`). Supports RAW, GLOBAL, XGD1, XGD2, XGD3, and Hybrid disc layouts. Provides both synchronous and asynchronous APIs with cancellation support. Strong-named and trimmable, with an AOT-compatible library surface.",
